          <rules>
            <rule id="acf6-2301-09cb-8530" name="Feat: Rites of Shadow" hidden="false">
              <description>When an enemy model is forced, casts a spell, and / or spends 1 or more focus or fury points while in Asphyxious&apos; control area, Asphyxious heals d3 damage points and gains one soul token. Rites of Shadow lasts for one round.</description>
