              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule id="75ae-e5ca-ff23-7229" name="Adapt" page="0" hidden="false">
              <description>When Cankerworm uses Salvage, you can adapt the Replicator. The Replicator gains the special rules and weapon qualities of one of the destroyed warjack&apos;s weapons. The Replicator becomes the type of weapon adapted (melee or ranged) and uses that weapon&apos;s RNG, ROF, AOE and POW. This effect lasts until Cankerworm uses Adapt again.</description>
