            <rule id="7d50b55f-16ac-93e7-5896-b464e51875c7" name="Reanimation" page="0" hidden="false">
              <description>Whe this model boxes a living enemy warrior model with a melee attack, add one Grunt to this unit and then remove the boxed model from play. The Grunt must be placed in formation and within 3&quot; of this model. The Grunt cannot activate this turn.</description>
