        <rule id="ccdbae72-12e2-0f7f-b6c1-f67aed0da41e" name="Leadership [Bloodgorgers]" page="0" hidden="false">
          <description>While in this model&apos;s command range, friendly Bloodgorger models gain Overtake. (When a model with Overtake destroys one or more enemy warrior modesl with a normal melee attack, after the attack is resolved this model can immediately advance up to 1&quot;.)</description>
