      <rules>
        <rule id="9d2396e5-c65f-d1a7-197b-a4cea9b8801a" name="Feat: Charnel Flames" page="0" hidden="false">
          <description>When a model is destroyed in Venethrax&apos;s control area, before removing the model from the table center a 3&quot; AOE cloud effect over it. The destroyed model does not provide a corpse token. Models with Eyeless Sight do not ignore these cloud effects. Models entering a Charnel Flames AOE suffer 1 point of fire damage. Charnel Flames lasts for one round.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="fdd2fe60-8e6a-c8f7-1b39-310ded9cb2fb" name="Caustic Presence [Corrosion]" page="0" hidden="false">
          <description>Corrosion continuous effects that affect enemy models in this model&apos;s control area cannot expire.</description>
