            <rule id="90852a40-0abe-6a88-96d8-44aa74a33dca" name="Granted: Force Barrier" page="0" hidden="false">
              <description>While this model is in play, models in its unit gain Force Barrier. (A model with Force Barrier gains +2 DEF against ranged attack rolls and does not suffer blast damage).</description>
            </rule>
            <rule id="0b17133b-7a4e-bdfa-c386-ce3934805c52" name="Power Swell" page="0" hidden="false">
              <description>Once per game during its unit&apos;s activaiton, this model can use Power Swell. During this activation, models in this unit gain an additional die on melee damage rolls.</description>
            </rule>
