            <rule id="49277ca9-7531-c21e-e2f9-3769c43d63cc" name="Model: Thrall Bomb" page="0" hidden="false">
              <description>When this model is disabled, center a 4&quot; AOE on it and then remove this model from play. Models in the AOE are hit and suffer a POW 8 blast damage roll.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule id="da948620-cf17-50eb-c284-f89c84bb77a1" name="Mechano-Claw: Death Burst (* Attack)" page="0" hidden="false">
              <description>This model makes a melee attack. If that attack hits, instead of dealing damage normally, center a 4&quot; AOE on the model hit and remove this model from play. The model hit suffers a POW 16 damage roll. If the attack misses, center the AOE on this model and remove this model from play. Models in the AOE other than the model directly hit are hit and suffer a POW 8 blast damage roll. Blast damage from this attack is not considered to have been caused by a melee attack.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
