          <description>Enemy models currently in Deneghra&apos;s control area suffer Shadow Bind for one round. (A model affected by Shadow Bind suffers -3 DEF and for one round when it advances it cannot move except to change facing.)</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="4229ac4f-6573-0455-05e3-2e5fe0c5f962" name="Wraith Walker" publicationId="f77f35f4--pubN66647" page="42" hidden="false">
