        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="98dc-4210-467e-6d8c" name="Watcher" hidden="false">
          <description>When an enemy model advances and ends its movement within 6&quot; of this model, choose a warjack in htis model&apos;s battlegroup that is in its control area. That warjack can immediately make a full advance and then can make one normal melee or ranged attack targeting the enem model. The attack and damage rolls against that model are boosted. After the attacks is resolved, Watcher expires.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
